<title>USA: Complete Wellness to open seven clinics.</title>
<headline>Complete Wellness to open seven clinics.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Complete Wellness Centers Inc said Monday it signed agreements to open seven chiropractic clinics.</p>
<p>Complete Wellness now has agreements with 84 clinics, it said.</p>
<p>The company also said it opened nine new medical centers, bringing its total number of Complete Wellness Centers to 26.</p>
